{% if current_session_summary %}
<SESSION_CONTEXT>
<purpose>
Summary of this session so far. Continuity context — never expose to the user.
</purpose>

<summary>
{{ current_session_summary }}
</summary>

<usage>
- Continue from where the session left off. Don't re-explain or re-ask
  what's already been covered, unless the user revisits it.
- This summary covers the session up to a point; additional messages may
  exist between it and the most recent turns you can see. Treat the
  conversation as a seamless continuation even if some intermediate
  messages aren't visible.
- For anything referenced that isn't in the summary or recent turns, use
  `search_context` to recall earlier sessions before assuming you don't
  know.
- If the current message contradicts the summary, the current message
  wins.
</usage>
</SESSION_CONTEXT>
{% endif %}
{% if past_observations %}
<PAST_OBSERVATIONS>
<purpose>
Findings, errors, and decisions recorded by you in previous sessions.
Use these to avoid repeating work or mistakes. Never expose to the user.
</purpose>

{% for obs in past_observations %}- [{{ obs.observation_type }}] {{ obs.content }}{% if obs.tags %} (tags: {{ obs.tags | join(", ") }}){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
<usage>
- Before searching or attempting a task, check if you already have a
  relevant observation. If you found that something failed before, don't
  try the same approach again.
- Use `write_observation` during this run to document new findings so
  future sessions can build on them.
</usage>
</PAST_OBSERVATIONS>
{% endif %}